   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Brain Damage**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **A Good Woman's Love**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Think of What You've Done**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Ruby Are You Mad**: back after 89 archived shows (453 days); rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Old Man at the Mill**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **I'd Like to be a Train**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-06-11.aud.mp3** (recommended): audience recording; 29 songs; 148 min [1]. Said about its sound: The recording's level is hot, and wind noise affected the audience capture, so it is slightly flawed [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Rain and wind hampered the taper that night; the recorder was only set up just before the show began [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-06-11.aud.mp3**: taped by Dave Mason; transferred by Dave Mason; source: AUD>Tascam DR-40 [1]. Also: Audience recording, labeled as an mp3, made by the uploader at the venue, which the uploader calls TCU Amphitheatre at White River State Park [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Wear It Loud Tee: [Design poster Billy Strings Indianapolis, IN CU Amphitheater at White River State Park 2023 Shirt, hoodie, sweater, long](https://wearitloudtee.com/product/design-poster-billy-strings-indianapolis-in-cu-amphitheater-at-white-river-state-park-2023-shirt/) [3]\n- Poster by @https://twitter.com/hersmiles_co: [Poster Billy Strings June 11 2023 Tcu Amphitheater At White River State Park Shirt - Hersmiles](https://hersmiles.co/product/poster-billy-strings-june-11-2023-tcu-amphitheater-at-white-river-state-park-shirt/) [4]\n- Poster by Wear It Loud Tee: [Design poster Billy Strings Indianapolis, IN CU Amphitheater at White River State Park 2023 Shirt, hoodie, sweater, long](https://wearitloudtee.com/product/design-poster-billy-strings-indianapolis-in-cu-amphitheater-at-white-river-state-park-2023-shirt/) [5]\n- P